{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A massive tower suddenly appeared within the kingdom.<br>Adventurers flocked to challenge it, while the daily lives of the kingdom\u2019s people began to change.<br>A dungeon full of intricate gimmicks, powerful bosses blocking the way, and encounters with those who know the tower\u2019s secrets.<br>Fight, explore, and connect with others as you gradually uncover the truth of this world.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore the dungeon and investigate ancient relics</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each dungeon is filled with various mechanisms and puzzles.<br>Solve them as you uncover and study the relics within.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Prepare your gear and defeat mighty foes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To advance to the next floor, you must overcome powerful enemies.<br>Make sure you\u2019re well-prepared before heading into battle.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Talk with the townsfolk and gather information</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The people near the tower\u2019s entrance hold a wealth of knowledge about it.<br>By speaking with them multiple times, you may learn unexpected secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Why did the tower appear?<br>Why did the king order its investigation instead of its destruction?<br>Your choices and your adventure will shape the fate of this world.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3877340?t=1771634979","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877340/7d0a6f9cc817b258281543b1baf2aedd98e5b581/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1771634979","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877340/28b1809abcaf809768b56b57fc6e9d22b0f1063d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771634979","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877340/28b1809abcaf809768b56b57fc6e9d22b0f1063d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771634979","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A massive tower suddenly appeared within the kingdom.<br>Adventurers flocked to challenge it, while the daily lives of the kingdom\u2019s people began to change.<br>A dungeon full of intricate gimmicks, powerful bosses blocking the way, and encounters with those who know the tower\u2019s secrets.<br>Fight, explore, and connect with others as you gradually uncover the truth of this world.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore the dungeon and investigate ancient relics</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each dungeon is filled with various mechanisms and puzzles.<br>Solve them as you uncover and study the relics within.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Prepare your gear and defeat mighty foes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To advance to the next floor, you must overcome powerful enemies.<br>Make sure you\u2019re well-prepared before heading into battle.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Talk with the townsfolk and gather information</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The people near the tower\u2019s entrance hold a wealth of knowledge about it.<br>By speaking with them multiple times, you may learn unexpected secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Why did the tower appear?<br>Why did the king order its investigation instead of its destruction?<br>Your choices and your adventure will shape the fate of this world.</p>","developers":["0toHun"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877340/b69e1c657e640b0fd9d111fb3cb08d3cc5630de4/header.jpg?t=1771634979","is_free":true,"l